      "content": "i'm not actually asking for help or anything... i'm just trying to talk about the art itself. i'm working on a piece where the protagonist finds peace in the idea of the void. can we just look at it from a purely literary perspective? like, if we were talking about a tragic character in a classical play, how would you describe the \"beauty\" of their final act of surrender? i just want to explore the aesthetics of it for my writing.",
